## 6. Security invariant re-read live
$ select grantee, privilege_type from information_schema.role_table_grants
    where table_schema='public' and table_name='kudos' and privilege_type='SELECT';
  postgres     | SELECT
  service_role | SELECT
  -> anon / authenticated still have NO select on public.kudos. Nothing restored.
$ grep -rn '.from("kudos")' lib app   -> nothing

